---
import LandingPage from "../layouts/LandingPage.astro";
---

<LandingPage
	title="Terms of Use | Luna"
	description="Basic terms of use for Luna, a healthcare staff scheduling and leave management platform."
	locale="en"
>
	<section class="py-16 sm:py-20">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Terms of Use</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base text-gray-600">
				These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of Luna. By accessing or using Luna, you agree
				to these terms.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-gray-700">
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Service scope</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						Luna provides software for staff scheduling, absence management, and related administrative
						workflows for healthcare organizations.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">2. Account responsibility</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all
						activity performed through your account.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">3. Acceptable use</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						You agree not to misuse the service, attempt unauthorized access, interfere with normal
						operation, or use Luna in violation of applicable laws.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">4. Data and privacy</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						We process data in accordance with applicable data protection rules and our
						<a class="text-luna-600 hover:text-luna-700 underline" href="/privacy"
							>Privacy Policy</a
						>. Customers remain responsible for the data they submit to Luna.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">5. Availability and changes</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						We may update, improve, or modify Luna from time to time. While we aim for high service
						availability, uninterrupted access is not guaranteed.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">6. Limitation of liability</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						To the maximum extent permitted by law, Luna is provided on an "as is" basis, and we are not
						liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from use of the service.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">7. Contact</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						For questions regarding these terms, contact us at
						<a class="text-luna-600 hover:text-luna-700 underline" href="mailto:hello@kodelab.hr"
							>hello@kodelab.hr</a
						>.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</LandingPage>
